    "Choose a bright spot with light in front of you, rather than behind you. A clear background helps the camera follow the ball." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Such dir einen hellen Platz, mit dem Licht vor dir statt hinter dir. Ein ruhiger Hintergrund hilft der Kamera, dem Ball zu folgen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige un lugar con buena luz, que te dé de frente y no por detrás. Un fondo despejado ayuda a la cámara a seguir el balón."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisis un endroit lumineux, avec la lumière devant toi plutôt que derrière. Un fond dégagé aide la caméra à suivre le ballon."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha um lugar claro, com a luz na sua frente e não atrás. Um fundo limpo ajuda a câmera a acompanhar a bola."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a duration, then record in the camera. It stops at the target. Keep the player and ball visible; include both feet, knees, head and chest, plus deliberate hand catches and ground bounces." : {
      "comment" : "Debug, lab or unused screen; not shown in release builds.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false
